---
title: Launch plan
displayMode: compact
config:
  theme: forest
  gantt:
    topAxis: true
    barGap: 6
---
gantt
    accTitle: Launch plan, for screen readers
    accDescr: The tasks, milestones and markers of the launch.
    dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
    axisFormat %d %b
    tickInterval 1week
    weekday monday
    excludes weekends, 2026-07-03, holidays
    includes 2026-07-04
    todayMarker stroke-width:3px,stroke:#f00

    %% Before the first section
    Kick-off :milestone, kickoff, 2026-06-01, 0d

    section Build
    %% The API comes first
    Design API :done, design, 2026-06-01, 5d
    Build API :crit, active, build, after design, 2w
    Review :review, after design build, until release
    Write docs :docs, after build, 1.5d
    Load test :crit, test, after ghost build, 3d
    click build href "https://ci.example.com/build"
    click test call openTicket("test")

    section Launch
    Code freeze :vert, freeze, 2026-06-24, 1d
    Pilot :pilot, 2026-06-29, 1M
    Release :milestone, release, after test, 2d
    Announce :announce, after release, 500ms
    Retro :retro, after announce, soon
    A line Mermaid cannot read
